  <div class="half-span">
    <p class="home-title"><em>Hello!</em> I help enterprise and federal teams operationalize inclusive design. By bridging the gap between Figma and production code, I build the frameworks that empower teams to scale accessibility without losing velocity.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="half-span home-intro">
    <p>With over a decade of experience, I specialize in the <b>technical orchestration of accessibility</b>. My work moves inclusive design from a reactive, "final-gate" audit to a foundational Shift-Left requirement.</p>
    <p>I build systems like <b>native-mobile annotation kits</b> and <b>automated delivery frameworks</b> that empower cross-functional teams to deliver high-quality, accessible products at scale.</p>    
  </div>

</div>

